Id: con015c
Severity: CONFIG
Category: tigris
Check: config
Fix: Remove the file, or chown it to root; start Tigris from a directory only root can write to.
References: tigris(8)

The configuration file listed was not read because someone other than
root, the user running Tigris or the owner of Tigris's own files owns
it. Tigris runs its configuration files as shell code, as the user
running it, so a ./site or ./tigris.conf that another user left in the
directory Tigris was started from would otherwise run their commands
as root.
